sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as pg-boss cron
  participant W as Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Source (ATS API)
  participant L as Ollama
  participant UI as Web UI
  C->>W: discover.run (08:00 IST)
  W->>DB: create SearchRun RUNNING
  loop each enabled source
    W->>S: GET jobs (throttled, UA set)
    S-->>W: JSON jobs
    W->>DB: dedupe + insert new Jobs
  end
  W->>C: enqueue jobs.process per new Job
  loop each new job
    W->>L: extract JD to JSON
    L-->>W: JobExtract
    W->>L: embed(description)
    L-->>W: vector
    W->>DB: scoreJob() then upsert JobMatch
  end
  W->>DB: SearchRun SUCCEEDED + stats
  W->>DB: Notification "7 new matches"
  UI->>DB: poll /notifications (or SSE)
  DB-->>UI: unread badge
